1
00:00:01,918 --> 00:00:03,044
Jeongho, let's go!

2
00:00:06,089 --> 00:00:07,465
I don't feel so well.

3
00:00:08,466 --> 00:00:09,466
You should

4
00:00:10,385 --> 00:00:11,469
start without me today.

5
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:13,470
Are you okay?

6
00:00:14,139 --> 00:00:15,139
Yeah.

7
00:00:16,474 --> 00:00:17,714
I will take some rest
for today.

8
00:00:18,226 --> 00:00:19,477
Are you sure you are okay?

9
00:00:20,687 --> 00:00:21,896
You were find this morning.

10
00:00:21,896 --> 00:00:22,939
I told you, I'm okay.

11
00:00:26,484 --> 00:00:26,985
Sorry.

12
00:00:27,318 --> 00:00:28,987
I'll be alright
after some rest.

13
00:00:29,863 --> 00:00:30,863
Okay.

14
00:00:31,406 --> 00:00:32,949
If there is something wrong

15
00:00:33,324 --> 00:00:34,324
please tell me.

16
00:00:42,792 --> 00:00:43,918
I can never tell you.
